<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About - URL Shortener</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 antialiased">
    <%- include('partials/header'); -%>

    <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12">
      <section
        class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/85 p-8 shadow-xl shadow-slate-950/40 backdrop-blur-lg"
      >
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-cyan-400">
              Project Architecture
            </p>
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-4xl">
              About this URL Shortener
            </h1>
            <p class="text-slate-400">
              This project is a lightweight web application designed to turn
              long URLs into short, shareable links with a minimal, responsive
              interface.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div
            class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/75 p-6"
          >
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">
              Architecture Overview
            </h2>
            <ul
              class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 marker:text-cyan-400 list-disc list-inside"
            >
              <li>
                <span class="font-semibold text-white">Express.js</span> serves
                as the web server and routing layer for both page rendering and
                API requests.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="font-semibold text-white">EJS</span> renders the
                frontend views from `src/views`, with common layout pieces kept
                in partials.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="font-semibold text-white">Mongoose</span> connects
                to MongoDB and stores shortened links in a simple `links` model.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="font-semibold text-white">Static assets</span> are
                served from `src/public`, including the favicon and any
                client-side scripts or styles.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div
            class="space-y-4 rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/75 p-6"
          >
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">Folder Structure</h2>
            <p class="text-slate-300">
              The project is organized to keep features clear and maintainable:
            </p>
            <ul
              class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 marker:text-cyan-400 list-disc list-inside"
            >
              <li>
                <span class="font-semibold text-white">src/routes/</span> for
                page routes.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="font-semibold text-white">src/api/routes/</span>
                for API-specific routing.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="font-semibold text-white"
                  >src/api/controllers/</span
                >
                for request handling logic.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="font-semibold text-white">src/models/</span> for
                database schemas.
              </li>
              <li>
                <span class="font-semibold text-white">src/services/</span> for
                reusable service functions like URL creation and lookup.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div
            class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/75 p-6 text-slate-300"
          >
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">GitHub Repository</h2>
            <p class="mt-2">
              Explore the source code, issues, and contribution details on
              GitHub:
            </p>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/wishrohitv/url_shortener"
              target="_blank"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-slate-800 px-4 py-3 text-cyan-300 transition hover:bg-slate-700 hover:text-white"
              >https://github.com/wishrohitv/url_shortener</a
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
